From: BlackF1re <55582873+BlackF1re@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: iommu: qcom: add TrustZone-managed MSM8226

MSM8226 MDP SMMU is TrustZone-managed with secure ID1 in the vendor
BSP. Physical device probing confirmed that reading global IDR0 through
arm-smmu triggers an external abort at fd928020 despite enabled clocks
and power. Describe it using the qcom_iommu framework for global-register
inaccessible implementations. Non-secure context bank0 is at fd930000.

Signed-off-by: BlackF1re <55582873+BlackF1re@users.noreply.github.com>
---
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/qcom,iommu.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/qcom,iommu.yaml
index 93a489025..3582def5e 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/qcom,iommu.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/qcom,iommu.yaml
@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@ properties:
     oneOf:
       - items:
           - enum:
+              - qcom,msm8226-iommu
               - qcom,msm8916-iommu
               - qcom,msm8917-iommu
               - qcom,msm8937-iommu
